ayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/17/6379517/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは埼玉県なんですけど、\nいつか大っきいカバン持って、もっと遠くのキラキラした景色を\n見に行ってみたいです。(*´ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは、どっか行きたいとこありますかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/17/6379517/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/17/6379517/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/17/6379517/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/17/6379517/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-38102":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2017/04/15/5938551/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ブログのタイトルにもなっている\n「はぶてとるん？」は大窪シゲキさんの\n9ジラジという番組で教えて頂いた\n広島弁ですよ？♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味が分かる方はいるかな？\n※答えは下に書いときますね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は、はぶてるで「ふてくされる」「拗ねる」\n私は疑問形にしてあるので「拗ねてるの？」\nっていう意味でした( ˊᵕˋ )ぱちぱち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い可愛い方言！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とそんな感じで昨日今日と広島に行って\n「インフルエンサー」の\nキャンペーンしてきました